# Who may read/write which topics (see README "MQTT topics").
# The web app reads everything but may write only commands, rules and routines.
# To add a web user: run ./setup-users.sh <name> and copy the webadmin block.

user board
topic readwrite home/#

user webadmin
topic read home/#
topic write home/+/+/set
topic write home/system/rules
topic write home/system/routines
